    "body": "@domenic Correction: I should have said changes in page title are not treated as \"live regions\" in accessibility APIs\r\n\r\n[kLiveRegionChanged](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:ui/accessibility/ax_enums.mojom;drc=30309877d4b10434eeaa9f85e8ba00ca91c7d731;bpv=1;bpt=1;l=59?gsn=kLiveRegionChanged&gs=kythe%3A%2F%2Fchromium.googlesource.com%2Fchromium%2Fsrc%3Flang%3Dmojom%23ax.mojom.Event.kLiveRegionChanged)\r\n\r\nHowever, both NVDA and JAWS fail to report changed title values, even when forced to do so. It's definitely not reliable enough to comply with WCAG.",
